    "Reason : 1 - The proposed first floor rear extension, by reason of its excessive depth, position, size, design and appearance, would be intrusive and unneighbourly addition in this conservation area, out of scale and character with this and neighbouring dwellings, as well as having an adverse effect on the amenities enjoyed by the occupants of neighbouring property. Thus, it is contrary to Local Plan policies SC7, CC1, CC2 and CC4 of Local Plan, Residential Extension Guidelines, policies D4 and HC1 of London Plan and the National Planning Policy Framework."
